{
  "info": {
    "name": "Test Winx - Produtos e Autenticação",
    "description": "Coleção v2.1 para a API em http://localhost. Preencha email e password nas variáveis; name é usado no cadastro. Para um usuário novo, execute Cadastrar usuário e depois Login. Login captura token e as requisições protegidas herdam Bearer {{token}}. Criar produto captura product_id. Execute Logout ao encerrar. Recuperação de senha é manual: execute Forgot password, copie o token do email (com MAIL_MAILER=log, consulte storage/logs/laravel.log), preencha reset_token e new_password, e execute Reset password. Após sucesso, password é atualizado, token e reset_token são limpos; faça Login novamente. Tokens de acesso duram 24 horas e de recuperação 60 minutos. Rotas públicas têm limite compartilhado de 5 requisições/minuto por IP e recusam usuários autenticados com 409. Não execute a coleção inteira de uma vez: cadastro e recuperação são fluxos opcionais.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "product_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "email",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "name",
      "value": "Usuário de teste",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "reset_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "new_password",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Autenticação",
      "description": "Cadastre um usuário novo, se necessário, e execute Login. As requisições públicas não enviam Bearer token.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cadastrar usuário",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/register",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{name}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Cadastre um email novo antes do login. Senha: pelo menos 8 caracteres, com letras e números; máximo de 72 caracteres."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", pm.response.json().data.token); } else { pm.collectionVariables.unset(\"token\"); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Usuário autenticado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/user",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "user"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Produtos",
      "description": "Exige Login. Execute na ordem para criar, consultar, atualizar e excluir um produto de teste.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01 - Criar produto",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/products",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "products"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Cria um produto e salva automaticamente seu ID na variável product_id da coleção.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Teclado mecânico\",\n  \"description\": \"Teclado USB com iluminação\",\n  \"price\": \"199.90\",\n  \"stock\": 10,\n  \"category\": \"Electronics\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 201\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"product_id\", String(pm.response.json().data.id));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "02 - Listar produtos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/products?per_page=15&page=1",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "per_page",
                  "value": "15"
                },
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "03 - Filtrar produtos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/products?name=Teclado&min_price=100.00&max_price=300.00&in_stock=true&per_page=10&page=1&category=Electronics",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "name",
                  "value": "Teclado"
                },
                {
                  "key": "min_price",
                  "value": "100.00"
                },
                {
                  "key": "max_price",
                  "value": "300.00"
                },
                {
                  "key": "in_stock",
                  "value": "true"
                },
                {
                  "key": "per_page",
                  "value": "10"
                },
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "category",
                  "value": "Electronics"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Filtros combináveis: name (busca parcial), category (valor exato), min_price e max_price (inclusivos), in_stock (true/false), per_page (1 a 100) e page. Categoria diferencia maiúsculas e minúsculas."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "04 - Consultar produto",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/products/{{product_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "products",
                "{{product_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retorna id, name, description, category, price, stock, created_at e updated_at. Exige token; produto inexistente retorna 404."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "05 - Atualizar produto (PUT)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/products/{{product_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "products",
                "{{product_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Teclado mecânico atualizado\",\n  \"description\": \"Teclado USB revisado\",\n  \"price\": \"249.90\",\n  \"stock\": 8,\n  \"category\": \"Electronics\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "06 - Atualizar estoque (PATCH)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/products/{{product_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "products",
                "{{product_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"stock\": 0\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "07 - Excluir produto",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/products/{{product_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "products",
                "{{product_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Exclui o produto apontado por product_id. A resposta esperada não contém corpo."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 204\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(204); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - Encerrar sessão",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "logout"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 204\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 204) { pm.collectionVariables.unset(\"token\"); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 - Recuperação de senha (manual)",
      "description": "Execute separadamente. Preencha reset_token com o token recebido por email e new_password antes da redefinição.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Forgot password",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/forgot-password",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "forgot-password"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Envia instruções para o email cadastrado. A resposta não contém o token."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset password",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/reset-password",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "reset-password"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"token\": \"{{reset_token}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{new_password}}\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"{{new_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Token de uso único, válido por 60 minutos. Revoga todos os tokens de acesso do usuário."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"password\", pm.collectionVariables.get(\"new_password\"));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.unset(\"token\");",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.unset(\"reset_token\");",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
